 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the following information to answer questions 8 – 11.</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Four athletes on a track team are comparing their personal bests in the 100-meter and 200-meter events. A table of their best times is shown below.&nbsp;</p>\n  <table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Athlete</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">100 m time\n                (seconds)</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">200 m time\n                (seconds)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>1</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>12.95</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>26.68</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>2</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>13.81</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>29.48</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>3</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>14.66</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>28.11</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>4</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>14.88</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>30.93</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n <br>   <p>The line of best fit has an equation of <span data-math=\"y= 1.5115x + 7.526\">y= 1.5115x + 7.526</span>, where <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> represents the 100-meter time and <span data-math=\"y\">y</span> represents the 200-meter time.</p>\n</blockquote>",
